[gd_scene load_steps=26 format=3]

; M3-BPR-03: the Brine Shoals (Ch6 B01: ch06_ridge_skippers, ch06_ridge_crab, ch06_ridge_gulls, ch06_flats_crabs),
; greybox until env-art's Brine Shoals kit lands (M3-ENV-02). Grade from docs/kb/art/color_script.md "Ch6", the
; 15:30 haze: sun 35 deg, key #FFD5B3 2.4, fill #A8B8B0 0.55, rim #E0702E 0.7 (the far smoke's warmth, kept low
; here at 0.35), sky #7FA3C0 / #D8C8A8, fog #B8A890 (a thick afternoon haze), exposure 0.70, saturation x0.9; the
; water is silted_flats (deep #4A5A50). A grey-brown mud bank, flat at y = 0 around the fighters, with puddles;
; wreck-ridges of black Lit Age hull plating and wooden hulks behind the foes and the party, a Saltwright chalk
; camp-sign on one plate, tide channels of grey-green water between the banks, and gulls high over the ridges.

